

**  Mon 14 Sep 2026 21:11:00 UTC by Ash Pera <ashley.pera@colorado.edu> **

  1x1 monthly means of ../v2026.2/CF/fossil_fuel_1x1_YYYYMMDD.nc (Andy's
  CF-ised copy of Sourish Basu & Ray Nassar's OCO-2 MIP fossil fuel prior,
  ODIAC x TIMES, v2026.2, https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19744619), one
  file per year, for the Miller-Pera FF product comparison
  (https://github.com/noaa-gml/Miller-Pera-FF, compare_products.py).

  Built by make_oco2ff_monthly.py (copy in this directory; canonical copy
  in the Miller-Pera-FF repo under orion/) with
  /work2/noaa/co2/miniconda3/envs/tm5_312/bin/python:

    python make_oco2ff_monthly.py --src ../v2026.2/CF --dst . --years 2000-2026

  'emission' = arithmetic mean of every hourly field in the month, mol C
  m-2 s-1, float32; plus n_source_hours, extrapolated (1 for Mar-Apr 2026,
  which are Andy's ncbo extension, not the published product), cell_area
  (spherical, R = 6371.009 km), month_seconds, time_bnds. Global attrs
  carry the source dir/file count and the source files' history/source.
  checksums.md5 covers the product files; build.log is the build output.
